~ start

if GameState.has_house_key
	PLUM: The door is locked. (sad)

	- Open the door and enter
		You unlock the door with the house key.
		VINCENT: This is it. Stay right next to me. (serious)
		=> END

	- Explore some more
		VINCENT: Seriously? Just open it... (angry)
		PLUM: Let me explore! There might be something else here. (angry)
		VINCENT: Women... (smug)
		PLUM: Women... (smug)
		=> END

else
	$> increment_choice("checked_locked_door")

	match get_choice_count("checked_locked_door")
		when 1
			PLUM: The door is locked. (sad)
			VINCENT: The key should be in the fountain over there.
			PLUM: Why is the key in the fountain? Why not just keep it on you? (thinking)
			VINCENT: Enough questions. Just get the key. (angry)
			=> END

		else
			PLUM: I forgot where the key is. (sad)
			VINCENT: Fountain.
			=> END